Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `bucket.values` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/semantic_capture_events_drive_retention_and_deferred_clone_modes_2.jet:13:39
    |
 13 |     both(() -> bucket.clear(), bucket.values)
    |                                       ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `bucket.values` only once, or copy first with `bucket.values.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
